Hi! I'm Iris, the amazingly strong
Gym Leader!{VAR BE01}
Tell me... What Pokémon are you using?
How will you fight?{VAR BE01}
Ooh, I'm super curious, so let's just
get started!{VAR BE01}

Whoooa!
That was so cool!{VAR BE01}
I'm sooo happy I could battle a Trainer
as strong as you!{VAR BE01}

Hey, that's your eighth Badge, right?
That's so cool!{VAR BE01}
Now every Pokémon will do what you ask,
no matter how big they are!{VAR BE01}
Know what? I'll give you this TM, too!{VAR BE01}

Dragon Tail doesn't just do damage.{VAR BE01}
It sends the other Pokémon back to its
Poké Ball, too!{VAR BE01}

Ooh, hey!
I wonder how Mister Alder is doing?{VAR BE01}
I wonder if he's battling that Trainer
called N in the Pokémon League right now?{VAR BE01}
Do you know about the Pokémon League?{VAR BE01}
It's past Victory Road, at the end of
Route 10!

You've been on a journey and seen a lot
of the world.{VAR BE01}
I'm like that, too! I'm from way out in
the country.{VAR BE01}
I'm really happy that I've gotten to
meet lots of different people{VAR BE00}
and Pokémon!!

You've been on a journey and seen a lot
of the world.{VAR BE01}
I'm like that, too! I'm from way out in
the country.{VAR BE01}
I'm really happy that I've gotten to
meet lots of different people{VAR BE00}
and Pokémon!!

Welcome. Thank you for coming. I am
Opelucid Pokémon Gym's Leader, Drayden.{VAR BE01}
As the mayor, I've given everything
to developing the city.{VAR BE01}
As a Trainer, I've simply been pursuing
greater strength.{VAR BE01}
But what I'm searching for now is a young
Trainer who can show me a bright future.{VAR BE01}
Perhaps you can show me that future,
the way Iris has?{VAR BE01}

Wonderful.{VAR BE01}
I'm grateful we had a chance to meet
and battle.{VAR BE01}

Well, now. You've obtained all of the
Gym Badges in Unova.{VAR BE01}
Now, all Pokémon will obediently follow
your commands.{VAR BE01}
I also want you to have this.
It's a TM I'm particularly fond of.{VAR BE01}
It's called Dragon Tail.{VAR BE01}

Dragon Tail is a move that returns the
damaged Pokémon to its Poké Ball.{VAR BE01}
In other words, it switches your
opponent's Pokémon.{VAR BE01}

Now, I have something to ask of you.{VAR BE01}
Head for the Pokémon League and
go after Alder.{VAR BE01}
The Pokémon League is past Route 10,
which runs from Opelucid City{VAR BE00}
to Victory Road.{VAR BE01}
I know Alder's strength, but I don't
know the depths of N's power...

Pokémon and people do not age because of
the passage of time.{VAR BE01}
They get old when the energy flowing in
their hearts dries up.{VAR BE01}
This energy in our hearts is powered by
truth, ideals, or maybe dreams...{VAR BE01}
That probably changes with what you most
hope for in your life.

Thanks for coming!
I happily welcome you!{VAR BE01}
But...
I may be a little rough on you!{VAR BE01}

Welcome to the Opelucid Gym, the Unova
region's strongest and biggest trial!{VAR BE01}
First off, please take this Fresh Water.
It'll help you in the challenge ahead.{VAR BE01}

Let me give you a brief explanation of
the trick to the Opelucid Gym!{VAR BE01}
The path around this Gym is shaped like
two dragons.{VAR BE01}
This path changes when you step on
the switches on the dragons' arms.{VAR BE01}
Pay attention to how the dragons'
necks move!

You beat the Gym Leader?
Wow, that's amazing!{VAR BE01}
Oh, by the way, since I gave you all that
Fresh Water...{VAR BE00}
Don't you owe me some of your winnings?{VAR BE01}
...I'm kidding! It's just a joke!
No, seriously, congratulations!

